&quot;StockTok&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:&quot;Economist and investor for 17 years, providing daily updates - TikTok: 571,000 followers&quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a4c61c40-9364-4166-877a-b0163fb9610d_854x854.png&quot;,&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:100}],&quot;post_date&quot;:&quot;2025-01-20T13:11:47.030Z&quot;,&quot;cover_image&quot;:&quot;https://substack-video.s3.amazonaws.com/video_upload/post/155156984/735e6425-d992-4e73-ac2c-4df580e8277d/transcoded-1737345086.png&quot;,&quot;cover_image_alt&quot;:null,&quot;canonical_url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/chinas-economy-making-moves&quot;,&quot;section_name&quot;:null,&quot;video_upload_id&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:155156984,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;podcast&quot;,&quot;reaction_count&quot;:43,&quot;comment_count&quot;:11,&quot;publication_id&quot;:null,&quot;publication_name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;publication_logo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F96c222d2-04e7-4e47-9e11-4b10f4cee9c4_854x854.png&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;youtube_url&quot;:null,&quot;show_links&quot;:null,&quot;feed_url&quot;:null}\"></div><p>We ended up taking profits on BABA as the earnings date was uncertain at the time, and earnings have consistently been a coin toss. Massive losses on various “reputable” stocks like Walmart and Nvidia at their earnings were warning signals to not gamble 50/50 odds. Regardless, we have been awaiting a consolidation. And that brings us to today…where we have TWO optimal stock picks…</p>",
